
@startuml 08_PlayerBoostService

title 8. PlayerBoostService - 보유 부스트 아이템(폭탄/스왑 등) 관리

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum BoostKind {
  Bomb
  Swap
  Magnifier
  Hammer
  Potion
  Dice
}

class PlayerBoostInventory {
  - PlayerId: Guid
  - BoostKind: BoostKind
  - OwnedQuantity: int
  + AddToInventory(amountToAdd: int): void
  + UseFromInventory(amountToUse: int): bool
}

class BoostSelectionForSession {
  - GameSessionId: Guid
  - BoostKind: BoostKind
  - SelectedQuantity: int
}

interface PlayerBoostRepository {
  + FindInventoryByPlayerId(playerId: Guid): Task<List<PlayerBoostInventory>>
  + SaveInventory(inventory: PlayerBoostInventory): Task
}

interface PlayerBoostService {
  + ListOwnedBoosts(playerId: Guid): Result<List<PlayerBoostInventory>, ServiceError>
  + AddBoost(playerId: Guid, boostKind: BoostKind, amountToAdd: int): Result<PlayerBoostInventory, ServiceError>
  + ReserveBoostsForSession(playerId: Guid, selections: List<BoostSelectionForSession>): Result<List<PlayerBoostInventory>, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

BoostSelectionForSession "*" --> "1" BoostKind
PlayerBoostInventory "1" -- "1" BoostKind

PlayerBoostService ..> PlayerBoostRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
PlayerBoostService ..> PlayerBoostInventory
PlayerBoostRepository ..> PlayerBoostInventory
PlayerBoostService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of PlayerBoostService
  판정 규칙: ReserveBoostsForSession은 요청한 수량이
  보유 수량(OwnedQuantity)보다 많으면 NotEnoughBoostQuantity 실패.
  게임 시작 시 GameSessionService가 이 서비스를 호출함.
end note

@enduml
